    {
      "description": "Discito is a native iOS flashcard app built around FSRS-6, with iCloud sync, on-device AI card generation, lecture-audio-to-flashcards, image occlusion authoring, and full-fidelity import/export. One-time purchase, no subscription.\nDiscito uses its own Swift FSRS-6 port (validated for parity against py-fsrs), with the parameter optimizer bridging fsrs-rs via swift-bridge FFI.",
      "items": [],
      "title": "Discito"
    },
    {
      "description": "A simple yet powerful spaced repetition system designed to help you remember more. It uses AI to automatically generate cards and FSRS-5 to schedule your reviews.\nRember uses ts-fsrs.",
      "items": [],
      "title": "Rember"
    },
    {
      "description": "Revu is a local-first spaced repetition app for macOS built with SwiftUI. It features a Notion-inspired interface, Anki import (.apkg/.colpkg), study guides, exams, and workload forecasting.\nRevu uses swift-fsrs.",
      "items": [],
      "title": "Revu"
    },
