      "description": "SpacedCards is an iOS flashcard app which forces students to review cards to unlock scrolltime. It works offline, is customizable & has AI for generating cards (images, audio or PDFs).\nSpacedCards uses dart-fsrs.",
      "items": [],
      "title": "SpacedCards"
