      "description": "TiddlyWiki is a customizable single HTML file personal wiki for creating interlinked notes. Its open-source nature and plugin ecosystem make it adaptable for various uses, from project management to knowledge systems. With the FSRS plugin, TiddlyWiki can also be used as a flashcard app for learning and memorization.\nFSRS is available as a fork of the Tidme plugin for TiddlyWiki: fsrs4tw",
