    {
      "description": "Leitner sytem sorts flashcard into groups according to how well the learner knows each one in Leitner's learning box. The learners try to recall the answer written on a flashcard. If they succeed, the card is sent to the next box. If they fail, the card is sent back to the first box. In each successive box, the amount of time before the learner is required to revisit the cards increases. (More: Wikipedia)",
